{"title": "Dead (Condition)", "pageid": 7975, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dead_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dead Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dead_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Dead_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Dead</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>This creature is dead.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Dead\">Sources of Dead</span></h2>\n<ul><li>If a playable character or companion fails three <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Death Saving Throw\">Death Saving Throws</a> after being <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Downed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/66/Downed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\">Downed</a> they become dead.</li>\n<li>If a non-playable creature reaches zero <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit points</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/Damage\" title=\"Damage\">damage</a> that is not <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Non-Lethal_Damage_(Condition)\" title=\"Non-Lethal Damage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"non-lethal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Non-Lethal_Damage_(Condition)\" title=\"Non-Lethal Damage (Condition)\">non-lethal</a> they become dead.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This condition can be removed from <a href=\"/wiki/Hirelings\" title=\"Hirelings\">hirelings</a>, the player character, and their <a href=\"/wiki/Companions\" title=\"Companions\">companions</a> with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Revivify\" title=\"Revivify\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp/20px-Revivify_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp/30px-Revivify_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp/40px-Revivify_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Revivify\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp/20px-Revivify_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Revivify_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Revivify\" title=\"Revivify\">Revivify</a>, a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Revivify\" title=\"Scroll of Revivify\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Revivify\" title=\"Scroll of Revivify\">Scroll of Revivify</a>, the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_True_Resurrection\" title=\"Scroll of True Resurrection\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_True_Resurrection\" title=\"Scroll of True Resurrection\">Scroll of True Resurrection</a> or through <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/20px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/30px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/40px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Withers'\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/20px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\">Withers'</a> services.\n<ul><li>Non-playable characters cannot be revived after dying.</li>\n<li>In most cases, companions who die before recruitment – or during certain <a href=\"/wiki/Companions#Permanent_removal\" title=\"Companions\">plot events</a> – cannot be revived.</li>\n<li>Temporary companions with scripted deaths, namely <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/38px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/50px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alfira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\">Alfira</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Losiir\" title=\"Losiir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Portrait_Losiir.png/25px-Portrait_Losiir.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Portrait_Losiir.png/38px-Portrait_Losiir.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Portrait_Losiir.png/50px-Portrait_Losiir.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Losiir\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Portrait_Losiir.png/25px-Portrait_Losiir.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Portrait_Losiir.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Losiir\" title=\"Losiir\">Losiir</a>, cannot be revived.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">This creature is dead.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715052726\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.273 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.283 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 27083/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 318374/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 99465/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 86/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6/5000000 b